n}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NESLang}_{\\mathbf2}=\\mathsf{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nonerasing\\text{-}stack\\text{-}space\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NESLang}_{\\mathbf2}=\\mathsf{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nonerasing\\text{-}stack\\text{-}space\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NEDSLang}_{\\mathbf2}=\\mathsf{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+1)\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nonerasing\\text{-}stack\\text{-}space\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NEDSLang}_{\\mathbf2}=\\mathsf{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+1)\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>固定输入后，将栈顶以下部分对状态和输入头位置的影响压成转移摘要。确定性摘要大小为 O(n log n)，非确定性摘要为 O(n²)；增栈时更新摘要即可模拟。反向利用输入头作长度计数，在栈上复制并校验有界空间配置。原书本节给出证明草图，本条保留这一证据层级；n+1 与 n+2 只修正有限小长度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-stack-automaton-variants","status":"resolved","id":"cd94bc0acee32218","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-stack-automaton-variants]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"54